# 📊 Google One-Style Subscription Dashboard

A subscription analytics dashboard that tracks subscriber growth, churn, revenue, and ARPU using SQL + Power BI — built to simulate Google One’s financial KPIs.

---

## 🔧 Tech Stack
- SQL (querying and data transformation)
- Power BI (dashboard + DAX)
- Excel (mock data simulation)
- GitHub (version control and publishing)

---

## 📈 Key KPIs Tracked
- Active Subscribers (monthly)
- Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR)
- Churn Rate
- Average Revenue per User (ARPU)
- Subscriber Growth Rate
- Regional Performance Breakdown

